```
## Git push
```bash
git push --force-with-lease origin main    # Safest
git push -f origin main
```
## Git pull
```bash
# 1. Fetch the latest changes from the remote repository
git fetch origin

# 2. Hard reset your current branch to match the remote branch (replace 'main' with your branch name)
git reset --hard origin/main

# 3. Clean
git clean -fd  
```



## CARGO

## Rust — Cargo Project
```
cargo new <name>                  # new binary project
cargo new <name> --lib            # new library project
cargo init                        # init in existing dir
cargo build                       # compile (debug)
cargo build --release             # compile (optimized)
cargo run                         # build + run
cargo run --release
cargo check                       # fast type-check, no binary
```

## Rust — Dependencies
```
cargo add <crate>                 # add dependency
cargo add <crate>@<version>
cargo remove <crate>
cargo update                      # update Cargo.lock
cargo tree                        # dependency tree
```

## Cargo Watch
```bash
cargo watch -c -q -i "static/css/main.css" -x "run --bin nour"
cargo watch -c -q -x "run --bin nour"
cargo watch -q -c -x "run --bin main"

cargo clean -p package_name

```

